### REST Client — S8.3 Despliegue automatizado.
### Estrategia + health check + rollback.

@host = http://localhost:5107

### Salud
GET {{host}}/health

### Estrategia: App Service con slots → SlotSwap (slide 3)
GET {{host}}/deploy/estrategia?tipoApp=AppService&tieneSlots=true

### Estrategia: Functions Consumption → DirectDeploy
GET {{host}}/deploy/estrategia?tipoApp=Functions

### Estrategia: Functions Premium → SlotSwap (slide 3/13)
GET {{host}}/deploy/estrategia?tipoApp=Functions&planPremium=true

### Estrategia: MSIX → AppInstaller (slide 6)
GET {{host}}/deploy/estrategia?tipoApp=Msix

### Estrategia: Infra Bicep → WhatIfApprove (slide 7)
GET {{host}}/deploy/estrategia?tipoApp=Infra

### Health check: pasa al 2º intento (slide 9 — retry 5x10s)
POST {{host}}/deploy/healthcheck
Content-Type: application/json

{ "statusEsperado": 200, "maxIntentos": 5, "intentos": [
  { "intento": 1, "statusObservado": 503 },
  { "intento": 2, "statusObservado": 200 } ] }

### Health check: falla los 5 intentos
POST {{host}}/deploy/healthcheck
Content-Type: application/json

{ "statusEsperado": 200, "maxIntentos": 5, "intentos": [
  { "intento": 1, "statusObservado": 503 },
  { "intento": 2, "statusObservado": 503 },
  { "intento": 3, "statusObservado": 503 },
  { "intento": 4, "statusObservado": 503 },
  { "intento": 5, "statusObservado": 502 } ] }

### Smoke test funcional (slide 9)
POST {{host}}/deploy/smoke
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requests": [
  { "endpoint": "/api/productos", "statusObservado": 200 },
  { "endpoint": "/api/pedidos?limit=1", "statusObservado": 200 } ] }

### Smoke test: un endpoint cae
POST {{host}}/deploy/smoke
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requests": [
  { "endpoint": "/api/productos", "statusObservado": 200 },
  { "endpoint": "/api/pedidos", "statusObservado": 500 } ] }

### Rollback: App Service con slots → swap inverso ~5s (slide 8)
GET {{host}}/deploy/rollback?tipoApp=AppService&tieneSlots=true

### Rollback: MSIX → republicar previa con build+1 (slide 8)
GET {{host}}/deploy/rollback?tipoApp=Msix

### Rollback alternativo: desactivar feature flag (slide 10)
GET {{host}}/deploy/rollback/feature-flag?flag=FEATURE_NUEVA_BUSQUEDA

### Plan + checklist del entregable
POST {{host}}/deploy/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tipoApp": "AppService", "tieneSlots": true, "critico": true }
